  "circulation": "Teaching block has a compact indoor circuit. Campus loop uses green/plaza, library and union. Upper bridge links library to residence with a ground-level alternative; service tunnel reconnects teaching rooms to lobby without making a mandatory underground commute.",
  "systems": "Each building is an electrical/audio district. Cafe refrigeration, laboratory heat and tunnel ventilation are separate normal confounders. Campus boundary stops the playable cluster from implying an unlimited university.",
  "campaign": "Administration and residence records support a single bounded campus dossier. Future faculty/residence expansions remain outside this footprint until actually authored.",
  "refine": [
    "Tunnel arms and bridge bearings need exact connecting corridors; link centre lines are reservations, not finished bridge meshes.",
    "Subdivide dormitory rooms while retaining readable suite numbers and tested clear routes.",
    "Acquire campus plan reference and compare approved college concept before detailed construction."
  ],
